  title: H O M E
  button: HOME
  riddle: 'A book, a jar, a cup, a plate, a picture frame, a vase of flowers and
    three boxes. Two pictures at once: somebody is in trouble.'
  hint: On the left wall a dog sits up, ears pricked, as the flower pot tumbles off
    the table beside it. On the right wall, the man who saw it all.
  complete: 'HOME

    Home is where the heart is, broken pots and all.'
